Bool: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 1 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above

Ordering: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 2 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..2, free 0 below / 253 above

Rank: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 2 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..2, free 0 below / 253 above

Pair: size 16, align 4, stride 16, niche none
  .0 at 0: Maybe(Rank)
  .1 at 8: Maybe(Rank)

Maybe(Rank): size 8, align 4, stride 8, tag word at 0, payload at 4, niche none

Maybe(Maybe(Rank)): size 12, align 4, stride 12, tag word at 0, payload at 4, niche none

Maybe(&Int): size 16, align 8, stride 16, tag word at 0, payload at 8, niche none
